37663>>>        Boolean bHasRecord
37663>>>        Handle hoDD
37663>>>
37663>>>        Get Server to hoDD
37664>>>        Get GetNavigateData to NavigateData
37665>>>        Get HasRecord of hoDD to bHasRecord
37666>>>
