37873>>>                Case Break
37874>>>
37874>>>            Case Else // must be nfUndefined
37874>>>                // This may be the start of a drilldown query or this may be used for some kind of custom query.
37874>>>                // If Row select does main-zoom we don't need this
37874>>>                WebSet pbRender of oDetailButton to False
37875>>>
37875>>>        Case End
